Error [E0417]: `priv` and `pub` can't both apply to one item
  --> tests/ui/pub_file_pub_priv_conflict.jet:5:1
    |
  5 | priv pub fn secret() Int -> 0
    | ^^^^^^^^
 Why: An item is either public or private — pick one qualifier
 Fix: Drop `pub` (already public in a `#PubFile` file) or remove `priv`
